  "ingredients": [
    "2 tablespoons vegetable oil",
    "2 onions, minced",
    "2 cloves garlic, minced",
    "2 teaspoons fresh ginger root, finely chopped",
    "6 whole cloves",
    "2 (2 inch) sticks cinnamon, crushed",
    "1 teaspoon ground cumin",
    "1 teaspoon ground coriander",
    "salt",
    "1 teaspoon cayenne pepper",
    "1 teaspoon ground turmeric",
    "2 (15 ounce) cans garbanzo beans",
    "1 cup chopped fresh cilantro"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yrRuqjPHGVbEwFA7sAXqIHx4XBI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/34689-chickpea-curry-DDMFS-074-step-01-febdc09395c6427896fa8cb0fbe117e5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/34689/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a large frying pan over medium heat. Add onion; cook and stir until onions are tender, about 3 to 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/z56goucq86t7Ikx9oE_xeUCAPzc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/34689-chickpea-curry-DDMFS-092-step-02-5781e62471df46cd813546cded0f0bea.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/34689/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in garlic, ginger, cloves, cinnamon, cumin, coriander, salt, cayenne, and turmeric. Cook for 1 minute over medium heat, stirring constantly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TThR1vXwZVcluKyVpw3OUw7yuJM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/34689-chickpea-curry-DDMFS-095-step-03-9978242a253043488e91769e48412add.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/34689/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix in chickpeas and their liquid. Continue to cook and stir until heated through. Remove from heat. Stir in cilantro just before serving, reserving 1 tablespoon for garnish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/l2_W9Zu75aq81C9zVL2fdjtqSbI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/34689-chickpea-curry-DDMFS-096-step-04-8a99149d5bbd428f8b36f8b52eec6980.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/34689/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
